<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Avmin sells Anglo Pacific stake.</title>
<headline>Avmin sells Anglo Pacific stake.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Minerals Ltd said on Thursday it had sold its entire interest in Anglo Pacific Resources plc (APR) following a decision that the investment was no longer of a strategic nature.</p>
<p>Avmin has no further representation on APR's board.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
